msgid "The update was stopped before it finished."
msgstr "La actualización se detuvo antes de terminar."

msgid "Finishing an interrupted update"
msgstr "Terminando una actualización interrumpida"

msgid "The last update was cut short, most likely because the machine was switched off. It is being finished now."
msgstr "La última actualización se interrumpió, seguramente porque se apagó el equipo. Ahora se está terminando."

